Unforgiven"},{"slot":"Neck","name":"Talisman of Evasion","itemId":13177,"source":"LBRS - War Master Voone"},{"slot":"Shoulders","name":"Golden Mantle of the Dawn","itemId":19058,"source":"Leatherworking"},{"slot":"Back","name":"Stoneshield Cloak","itemId":12551,"source":"World drop (BoE)"},{"slot":"Chest","name":"Warbear Harness","itemId":15064,"source":"Leatherworking"},{"slot":"Wrists","name":"Blackmist Armguards","itemId":12966,"source":"UBRS - The Beast"},{"slot":"Hands","name":"Slaghide Gauntlets","itemId":13258,"source":"LBRS - Urok Doomhowl"},{"slot":"Waist","name":"Frostbite Girdle","itemId":14502,"source":"Scholomance - Ras Frostwhisper"},{"slot":"Legs","name":"Warstrife Leggings","itemId":11821,"source":"BRD - General Angerforge"},{"slot":"Feet","name":"Ash Covered Boots","itemId":18716,"source":"Stratholme - Archivist Galford"},{"slot":"Ring","name":"Ring of Protection","itemId":15855,"source":"EPL - Hidden Treasures quest"},{"slot":"Ring","name":"Myrmidon's Signet","itemId":2246,"source":"World drop (BoE)"},{"slot":"Trinket","name":"Mark of Tyranny","itemId":13966,"source":"UBRS quest reward"},{"slot":"Trinket","name":"Smoking Heart of the Mountain","itemId":11811,"source":"Enchanting"},{"slot":"Two-hand","name":"Manual Crowd Pummeler","itemId":9449,"source":"Gnomeregan - Crowd Pummeler 9-60"},{"slot":"Idol","name":"Idol of Brutality","itemId":23198,"source":"Stratholme - Magistrate Barthilas"}]}],"sources":["https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/feral-druid-leveling-talent-build-from-1-to-60","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/druid-healer-pre-raid-gear","https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/feral-druid-tank-pre-raid-gear","https://warcrafttavern.com/wow-classic/guides/pve-restoration-druid-talents-builds","https://www.warcrafttavern.com/wow-classic/guides/pve-feral-druid-dps-talents-builds/","https://www.wowhead.com/classic/guide/classes/druid/feral/tank-talent-builds-pve"]}],"route":["Alliance: starting zone to ~12, then Westfall/Darkshore-type zones, Redridge or Ashenvale, Duskwood, Wetlands, then Stranglethorn around the 30s.","Horde: starting zone to ~12, The Barrens to ~20, then bounce between Stonetalon, Ashenvale, Hillsbrad and Thousand Needles before Desolace and Stranglethorn in the 30s.","Both factions share the 40-60 path: Arathi, Stranglethorn, Swamp of Sorrows, Tanaris, Feralas, Hinterlands, Searing Gorge/Blasted Lands, Un'Goro, Felwood, Winterspring, then the Plaguelands.","Dungeon leveling works if your group is steady: Deadmines/Stockade (Alliance) or Ragefire/Wailing Caverns (Horde) early, then Scarlet Monastery 30-44, Zul'Farrak 44-49, BRD 49-56, LBRS 56-60.","Save time with a quest-helper addon like Questie, kill mobs along your path, skip elite and cross-world quests that pay little, and use flights for breaks.","Buy your mount at 40, keep First Aid and weapon skills current, and stock food/water; near 58 start farming Scholomance/Stratholme for pre-raid gear."],"routeSources":["https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/leveling-guide"],"notes":["Pre-raid gear lists assume every Classic Era phase is open. Some lists include PvP rank or late-phase items."]}